    "scope": "GRT8–9 identify the component volume at the selected deep level. GRT10–12 supply the unlabelled integral chart and smoothing for a given positive corrected potential. The signed chart identities, the model-specific height bounds and the trivial-flag comparison retain the hypotheses detailed in the manuscript."
